{"ticker":{"symbol":"001790.KS","name":"대한제당","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":2725.0,"change_pct":-0.001831501831501825,"market_cap":235009212416.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.044036697247706424,"week52_low":2150.0,"week52_high":3260.0,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Confectioners","country":"South Korea","city":"Incheon","employees":292,"website":"https://www.ts.co.kr","business_summary":"TS Corporation operates as a food company in South Korea. The company produces and supplies sugar and food stuff, food materials, additives, dairy products, and raw materials for bakery, mixed seasonings, and other agricultural products, as well as cocoa, fondant, and SMP products; and animal feed. It also develops various nutraceuticals and premium foods to control aging and prevent adult diseases; develops, produces, and markets two biological products, which include erythropoietin and streptokinase; trades in non-ferrous metals; and operates research labs. The company also exports its products to China, Southeast Asia, Micronesia, and internationally. The company was founded in 1956 and is headquartered in Incheon, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"TS Corporation은 한국에서 식품 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 설탕, 식품, 식품원료, 첨가물, 유제품, 제빵용 원료, 혼합조미료, 기타 농산물, 코코아, 퐁당, SMP 제품 등을 생산, 공급하는 회사입니다. 그리고 동물 사료. 또한, 노화방지 및 성인병 예방을 위한 다양한 기능성식품과 프리미엄 식품을 개발하고 있습니다. 에리스로포이에틴과 스트렙토키나제를 포함한 두 가지 생물학적 제품을 개발, 생산 및 판매합니다. 비철금속 거래; 연구소를 운영하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 또한 중국, 동남아시아, 미크로네시아 및 국제적으로 제품을 수출합니다. 이 회사는 1956년에 설립되었으며 본사는 대한민국 인천에 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"제과","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":1378075519000.0,"operating_income":38051122000.0,"net_income":25543443000.0,"eps":276.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":1332349884000.0,"operating_income":47216910000.0,"net_income":32573495000.0,"eps":354.0}